OL,3,GNEWSACity theatre to close for major
OL,4,Arefurb
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city centre theatre is to close for
OL,7,Fseven months to allow for a major
OL,8,Frevamp.
OL,10,FDesigned to protect its long-term
OL,11,Ffuture, the Bristol Hippodrome will
OL,12,Fshut its doors for the improvements
OL,13,Ffrom 4 January to 2 August 2027.
OL,15,FThe refurbishment will include repairs
OL,16,Fto the theatre's historic structure and
OL,17,Froof, as well as upgrades to essential
OL,18,Fheating, fire detection, cooling and
OL,19,Fwater systems.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
