OL,3,GNEWSACity theatre to close for major
OL,4,Arefurb
OL,5,
OL,6,FTheatre director Ben Phillips said:
OL,7,F"This work is all about looking after
OL,8,Four theatre and ensuring it remains a
OL,9,Fthriving home for live entertainment
OL,10,Ffor future generations."
